IN PLAIN ENGLISH (a friendly summary only — it is not part of the
license. The numbered sections below are the actual license terms.)

  Go ahead and:
    - use AutoTrash for free on your own mailboxes, for any reason;
    - change it, fix it, and improve it;
    - share it, including your improved version, publicly or privately,
      as long as it stays free;
    - link to it, list it, review it, and tell people about it.

  Just please:
    - don't sell it or make money from it without a paid license;
    - keep the credit to the original author, and don't claim it as
      your own;
    - include this license when you share it, and say what you changed.

  Your license won't be taken away on a whim. It can only end if you
  break these terms, and the first time, you get 30 days after being
  told to put things right.

  AutoTrash deletes email. It comes with no warranty, so test it with
  dry-run first and keep backups of anything important.
